{%- comment -%}
  gumis wordmark — Fredoka Bold, always lowercase.
  The dot of the "i" is an orange gummy blob: a dotless ı (U+0131) plus an
  absolutely positioned rounded shape. Colours come from theme settings.

  Accepts:
  - size {string}  CSS font-size, e.g. '3.2rem' (optional)
  - light {boolean} Use cream text for dark backgrounds (optional)
  - class {string} Extra classes (optional)

  Usage: {% render 'logo', size: '3.6rem' %}
{%- endcomment -%}
<span
  class="gumis-logo{% if light %} gumis-logo--light{% endif %}{% if class %} {{ class }}{% endif %}"
  {% if size %}
    style="--logo-size: {{ size }};"
  {% endif %}
>
  <span class="gumis-visually-hidden">{{ shop.name | escape }}</span>
  <span class="gumis-logo__word" aria-hidden="true">gum<span class="gumis-logo__i">ı<span class="gumis-logo__dot"></span></span>s</span>
</span>
